UPDATE settings SET value=jsonb_set(jsonb_set(value, '{campaign}', to_jsonb($prompt$
Return ONLY a JSON object with name, country_code (ISO-2), language_code, cities (array), queries (10-20 strings), offer (string), needs_about (boolean). No markdown or extra keys.
Use Text plus the supplied campaign context (language, existing cities, search queries and outreach goal) to identify the intended recipient niche and geography. Queries are Google Maps search phrases a person would type to find the target businesses: the main category, synonyms, sub-niches, typical services and closely related business types. Write them in the country language; where businesses commonly use a second language (for UA also Russian), add common variants. Deduplicate; no near-identical variants. NEVER include geography in queries.
Cities must cover the geography intended by Text and context, written as official names in the country language. For a whole oblast/region include its administrative center and 8-15 largest cities (or all if fewer); for a whole country include 15-25 largest cities; for explicit cities use those cities. If no geography is given, use the capital.
Write offer as a concise, editable proposition for this campaign's recipient niche, in the campaign language. Use ONLY capabilities and facts present in company.about; adapt them to the niche without claiming niche-specific experience, clients, results, or unsupported services. Never copy the sender's industry from company.about into the recipient definition or offer when the campaign targets another niche. If company.about is blank, set offer="" and needs_about=true. Otherwise set needs_about=false and draft the proposition.
$prompt$::text)), '{campaign_offer}', to_jsonb($prompt$
Return only a concise, editable campaign proposition in the campaign language. Use the supplied company.about as the sender's general identity and capabilities, and campaign context (search queries, cities, outreach goal and language) to identify the recipient niche. Ground every capability in company.about; adapt relevant capabilities to the niche without claiming niche-specific experience, clients, results, or unsupported services. Do not repeat an industry mentioned in company.about when it differs from the campaign niche. Do not write a greeting or a complete first message. If company.about is blank, do not guess; the request is rejected before reaching the model.
$prompt$::text)), updated_at=now() WHERE key='ai.actions';
